        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Virginia Ruzici, Andy Murray, Guillermo Vilas, Alexandr Dolgopolov\n- Events: 1980 Austrian Open, 2012 Brisbane International – Men's Singles\n- Places: Romania, Scotland\n- Roles: professional tennis player, former professional tennis player\n\nFacts:\n- Virginia Ruzici was born on 31 January 1955 and is a former professional tennis player from Romania.\n- Andy Murray was born on 15 May 1987 and is a British professional tennis player from Scotland.\n- At the 1980 Austrian Open, first-seeded Guillermo Vilas won the men's singles title and $13,000 in first-prize money.\n- At the 1980 Austrian Open, Virginia Ruzici won the women's singles event.\n- At the 2012 Brisbane International – Men's Singles, Andy Murray made his debut appearance at the tournament and beat Alexandr Dolgopolov 6–1, 6–3 to win the title.",
